@startuml C4 Broker Provider TBank

title C4: Provider-based integration with T-Bank (initial scope)

!define PERSON class
!define CONTAINER class

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

PERSON "оператор" as User

CONTAINER "MoonShine Admin UI" as MoonShine
CONTAINER "Laravel Backend" as Backend
CONTAINER "BrokerAccessService" as AccessService
CONTAINER "BrokerGatewayProviderFactory" as Factory
CONTAINER "BrokerCredentialResolver" as CredentialResolver
CONTAINER "TBankProvider" as TBankProvider
CONTAINER "TBankOperationsClient (REST/gRPC)" as OpsClient
CONTAINER "PortfolioCacheRepository" as CacheRepo
database "Redis" as Redis
database "PostgreSQL" as Db
database "brokers" as BrokersTable
database "brokerCredentials" as BrokerCredentialsTable
CONTAINER "T-Bank Gateway API" as Gateway

User --> MoonShine : Работает с кабинетами и портфелями
MoonShine --> Backend : HTTP

Backend --> AccessService : Validate ownership of broker
AccessService --> BrokersTable : Read available brokers for user profile
Backend --> Factory : Resolve provider
Factory --> CredentialResolver : Resolve credentials for selected broker
CredentialResolver --> BrokerCredentialsTable : Load token + secret
Factory --> TBankProvider : Create provider by broker/env
TBankProvider --> OpsClient : Portfolio/Positions/Operations
OpsClient --> Gateway : API calls

Backend --> CacheRepo : Read/write short-term data
CacheRepo --> Redis : TTL cache
Backend --> Db : Persist snapshots and metadata

note right of TBankProvider
Окружения:
- prod
- sandbox
end note

note right of BrokerCredentialsTable
Секреты не хранятся в runtime-конфиге.
token/secret берутся из brokerCredentials.
end note

@enduml
